<title>UK: Berlin Hannover Hypo adds 500 mln mark to bond.</title>
<headline>Berlin Hannover Hypo adds 500 mln mark to bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased for the second time to 2.0 bln marks from 1.5 bln marks, joint lead managers Bankgesellschaft Berlin, Dresdner Bank and Norddeutsche Landesbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BERLIN HANNOVERSICHE HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT  * 500 MLN DEM   COUPON     5.25	MATURITY    09.NOV.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.025   PAY DATE  **11.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  25 BP     REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> NOTES    * FIRST LAUNCHED ON JANUARY 4</p>
<p>	   ** PLUS ACCRUED INTEREST</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    BER HAN   PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    6 BP	SELL CONC  19 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
